# Brand constants

In `apps/edubridge`, **display name, tagline, public domain, and cookie prefix** come from one file: `apps/edubridge/lib/brand.ts`. Import `PLATFORM_NAME`, `PLATFORM_TAGLINE`, `PLATFORM_DOMAIN`, or `COOKIE_PREFIX` from `@/lib/brand` (or `../brand` inside `lib/`). Do not hardcode `EduBridge` / `edubridge.app` in UI, metadata, or copy. Do not add a second `PLATFORM_*` or `APP_NAME` constant elsewhere.

Legal keywords (entity, court, emails, versions, `LEGAL_DOCS_IN_FORCE`) stay in `apps/edubridge/lib/legal/constants.ts`. Cookie **names** use `COOKIE_PREFIX`, never `PLATFORM_NAME`.

```ts
// ❌ BAD — parallel constant or hardcoded brand
const APP_NAME = "EduBridge";
<title>EduBridge</title>

// ✅ GOOD — single source
import { PLATFORM_NAME } from "@/lib/brand";
<title>{PLATFORM_NAME}</title>
```
